<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .header-info {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .logo-container {
    float: left;
    margin-right: 40px;
  }
  .right-content {
    margin-left: 300px;
  }
  .section-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 40px 0 20px 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .form-label {
    flex: 0 0 200px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .form-input {
    flex-grow: 1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 60px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    padding-top: 5px;
    width: 200px;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
      <div class="logo-container">
        <!-- Placeholder for Logo -->
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">JAMIA HAMDARD</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 2px 0;">(HAMDARD UNIVERSITY)</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 2px 0;">(REACCREDITED BY NAAC IN GRADE 'A')</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 2px 0;">HAMDARD NAGAR, NEW DELHI-110062</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 2px 0;">Phone: {{ contact_phone }} | Telefax: {{ contact_fax }} | Website: {{ website_url }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">REQUEST FOR QUOTATION</h2>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin: 0;">(JH/PS/Quot-{{ quotation_number }}/{{ quotation_month }})</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>Sealed quotations are invited from reputed manufacturers/authorized distributors/resellers for <span data-field="quotation_purpose">{{ quotation_purpose }}</span> as per the specifications and Qty. are given below. The detailed terms & conditions are given as under:</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Terms and Conditions:-</div>

  <ol style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <li>Quotations may be submitted latest by <span data-field="submission_date_time">{{ submission_date_time }}</span> in an envelope superscribing "<span data-field="quotation_title">{{ quotation_title }}</span>" and addressed to: Registrar, Jamia Hamdard (University), Hamdard Nagar, New Delhi-110062 and dropped in the tender/quotation box available in the Purchase Section.</li>
    <li>Quotations will be opened on <span data-field="opening_date_time">{{ opening_date_time }}</span>.</li>
    <li>Prices should be quoted inclusive of all taxes on FOR Jamia Hamdard basis.</li>
    <li>Jamia Hamdard will deduct an amount of <span data-field="deduction_percentage">{{ deduction_percentage }}</span> from all the bills for "Jamia Hamdard Relief and Welfare Fund".</li>
    <li>The specifications given above should be strictly followed.</li>
    <li>The Technical Compliance Statement should be enclosed along with quotation, otherwise quotation can be rejected.</li>
    <li>Letter of Authorization from the company as Authorized Service Provider or Authorized Reseller should be attached.</li>
    <li>Warranty: Prices quoted should include <span data-field="warranty_period">{{ warranty_period }}</span> comprehensive on-site warranty.</li>
    <li>Delivery Period: Within <span data-field="delivery_period">{{ delivery_period }}</span>.</li>
    <li>Payment: <span data-field="payment_terms">{{ payment_terms }}</span> on delivery and successful satisfactory installation of Desk.</li>
    <li>The Vendors whose near relatives/blood relations are employed at Jamia Hamdard need not apply, and the same will not be considered.</li>
    <li>The Institute reserves not bind itself to accept the lowest quotation and reserves the right for accepting any quotation or to reject any or all quotations and also to reduce or enhance the quantity and period of order according to departmental requirement without assigning any reason.</li>
    <li>The decision of the University will be final in case of any dispute arising in implementation of the terms of the contract.</li>
    <li>TAN/PAN and Sale tax/VAT certificate should be attached with the quotation documents.</li>
  </ol>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <p>The above terms & conditions are accepted.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Name: <span data-field="signature_name">{{ signature_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Designation: <span data-field="signature_designation">{{ signature_designation }}</span></p>
      <p>Company Seal</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Registrar</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">SL.No.: <span data-field="sl_no_tender_form">{{ sl_no_tender_form }}</span></div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">TENDER APPLICATION FORM</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Cost of Tender Documents:</div>
    <div class="form-input">Rs. <span data-field="tender_cost">{{ tender_cost }}</span> (Non refundable)</div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Tender form for:</div>
    <div class="form-input">" <span data-field="tender_description">{{ tender_description }}</span> "</div>
    <div style="flex-grow: 1;">" Sl. No.: <span data-field="tender_sl_no">{{ tender_sl_no }}</span> "</div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Last date of Submission of Tender:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="tender_submission_date">{{ tender_submission_date }}</span> upto <span data-field="tender_submission_time">{{ tender_submission_time }}</span> p.m.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Date of opening of Tender:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="tender_opening_date">{{ tender_opening_date }}</span> at <span data-field="tender_opening_time">{{ tender_opening_time }}</span> p.m.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">Tender Document Fee:</div>
    <div class="form-input">DD / Receipt No. <span data-field="receipt_no">{{ receipt_no }}</span> Dated: <span data-field="receipt_date">{{ receipt_date }}</span> for Rs. <span data-field="receipt_amount">{{ receipt_amount }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin: 0;">VENDOR DETAILS :</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">1. Name of Firm / Company:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="vendor_name">{{ vendor_name }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">2. Authorised person:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="vendor_authorized_person">{{ vendor_authorized_person }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">3. Address:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="vendor_address">{{ vendor_address }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-label" style="flex: 0 0 150px;">Telephone(s):</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="vendor_phone">{{ vendor_phone }}</span></div>
    <div class="form-label" style="flex: 0 0 150px; margin-left: 30px;">Fax:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="vendor_fax">{{ vendor_fax }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label" style="flex: 0 0 150px;">E-mail:</div>
    <div class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 1;"><span data-field="vendor_email">{{ vendor_email }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-label">4. Income Tax No. / PAN No.:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="vendor_pan_no">{{ vendor_pan_no }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">5. Sales Tax No. / TIN No.:</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="vendor_tax_no">{{ vendor_tax_no }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-label">6. Experience Certificate (Attached photo copy):</div>
    <div class="form-input"><span data-field="vendor_experience_certificate">{{ vendor_experience_certificate }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-label">7. Details of Earnest Money (EMD):</div>
    <div class="form-input">DD / Banker Cheque No. <span data-field="emd_cheque_no">{{ emd_cheque_no }}</span> Dated: <span data-field="emd_date">{{ emd_date }}</span> for Rs. <span data-field="emd_amount">{{ emd_amount }}</span> Bank: <span data-field="emd_bank">{{ emd_bank }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>I/We agree to abide by the terms and conditions of the tender as laid down under Tender No. JH/PS/Quot-{{ quotation_number }}/{{ quotation_month }}.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block" style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <div>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Signature</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Name</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Designation</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Company Seal</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>